## Adding a new connection — checklist

Match the adapter-module pattern used above: a module that owns all outbound calls/credentials
for the connection, a demo-mode default when no config is present, never an inline fetch/SDK call
scattered directly into route/handler files. Document the new connection here in the same session
it's added — what triggers it, the request/response shape, the demo-mode fallback behavior, and
any constraint a future operator needs to know before it breaks silently in production.
